WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.150
<b>Winter Break, Not Long Ago</b>

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.480
Science

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.340
This part is wrong.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:12.890
Huh?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:18.740
What am I gonna do?
I don't get it at all, Tomocchi.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.270
Just follow the same pattern as before.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:22.960
Hang in there, Tsubasa!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.950
Let's study hard, pass the entrance exam,

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:35.300
and go to Sato High together! Okay?

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:37.640
Yeah!

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:43.840
Hydrogen!

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.610
Uh... Helium!

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.950
Lithium!

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:53.170
Um, uh...

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:55.320
"Happy Henry Likes Beer," Tsubasa!

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.240
Ah!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.490
What are you doing?

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:00.490
Exam prep!

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:07.210
We don't want Tsubasa to fail her
exams and have to miss practice.

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:10.720
E-Exams?! Is it that time of year already?!

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:12.790
You actually forgot?

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:17.560
Kawakita-san certainly is 
a good helper, though.

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:20.990
She always checks her homework for her, too.

00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:23.060
Don't you think you're spoiling her?

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:25.090
It's fine!

00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:27.020
'Cause we're...

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:29.190
best friends! Right?

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:32.090
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:08.950
<b>What We Do From Now On</b>

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:13.430
I think we should bump our
practice regimen up a notch,

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:16.640
to give us a chance
at winning our next game.

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:18.960
Then, let's get started right away.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:19.920
Yeah!

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:21.440
Here we go!

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:22.920
One out, runner on first!

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.430
You're next!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:29.780
Right!

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.530
Stay alert, second!

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:41.990
Right! Sorry, Tsubasa!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.450
Don't worry about it!

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:45.160
Next, right field!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.270
I caught it!

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:11.180
Nice catch, Akane-chan!

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:13.090
Keep it up!

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:14.110
Okay!

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:15.210
Here's one more!

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:16.200
Okay!

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:23.140
Nice catch!

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:26.270
Yeah! Looking good!

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.300
We put in a lot of work today!

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:34.940
See you all tomorrow!

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:36.960
Good work, girls!

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.280
Today really wore me out.

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:42.680
Our practices are really 
starting to come together now.

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:45.630
Think we're moving too fast?

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.680
No, we're not doing nearly enough.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:53.520
If we want to win, we need 
to practice even harder.

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:57.470
I'm sure Seijo's practices 
look nothing like ours.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.480
Then...

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:00.770
We'll work hard!

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:02.710
Indeed.

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:04.720
Yeah, we want to win next time.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:07.430
Let's work our tails off again tomorrow!

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:09.900
Work our tails off!

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:20.480
Was today's practice hard on you?

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:23.440
Huh? Maybe a little...

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:27.470
But everyone's really pumped,
so I have to do my part, too.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.100
Let me know if I can help out, okay?

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:37.560
I still need you to help me 
study for the exams, too!

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:40.190
Yeah, I suppose...

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:43.650
Seriously! I really need your help!

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:45.240
I know, I know.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:54.580
Reward for a high grade:

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:01.000
<i>I still have time, right?</i>

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:06.720
Huh?

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:10.680
One, two, three, four, five...

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.680
Oh, Tomocchi!

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:18.940
It's not time for practice yet. 
What are you all doing here?

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.650
I thought I'd start a little early today,

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.360
and I guess everyone else had the same idea.

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:28.410
Tomocchi, let's do our stretches.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:29.910
S-Sure.

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:34.280
I guess the next practice 
will be after our exams, huh?

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:36.670
So no practice for a whole week...

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:41.490
All right! Let's go get something 
to eat on the way home!

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:43.590
Yeah, I'm in!

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:45.310
Let's go!

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:48.200
Oh, okay. We'll catch up to you.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.070
Okay!

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:50.740
We'll see you there!

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:53.600
Is that a practice regimen?

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:57.020
I thought I'd practice on 
my own between exams.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.660
I came up with a pretty tough regimen...

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:02.480
What do you think?

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.910
Tomocchi...

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:07.730
You don't need to be in such a rush.

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:11.870
Everyone improves at their own pace.

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:13.070
But...

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:19.040
Once the exams are over,
I'll stay late to practice with you!

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.790
Come on, let's join the others.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.510
Tomocchi!

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.190
Er... Huh?

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:34.930
Kawakita-san went home already.

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:35.970
What?

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.430
<i>After we lost that game...</i>

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:01.790
<i>Did I feel as frustrated as everyone else?</i>

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:06.630
Bye!

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.090
See ya!

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:25.830
I didn't even know this was here.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:39.250
Aren't you...

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:46.170
You're Seijo's...

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:52.800
Jinguji-san?

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:57.260
Um... Do you practice here often?

00:08:57.260 --> 00:09:00.720
Yes. I always come here after team practice.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:03.400
The head priest here likes baseball,

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:07.100
so he said I could toss a ball around
on this bit of the temple grounds.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:08.430
Wow...

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:10.360
I'll be practicing over here.

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:12.730
Don't mind me. Carry on
with what you were doing.

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:17.200
Ah... um... I mean...

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:22.410
I shouldn't butt in...

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:26.140
But the way you held your glove out earlier...

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:28.680
You won't get away with that in a game.

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:31.270
Before practicing on your own,

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:34.590
I recommend seeking guidance from
someone who's qualified to coach you.

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:36.300
Well, anyway...

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:38.260
What am I doing wrong?

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:41.600
Please, don't hold back! Be strict with me!

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:45.060
You should ask your teammates, not me—

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:47.060
Tsubasa can't help me!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:48.770
Tsubasa?

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.110
Please!

00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:53.660
All right, fine, but...

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.050
Give me some space.

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:58.650
Oh... S-Sorry.

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:02.740
Kawakita-san's acting strange?

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:06.920
Yeah... She promised to study with me,

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:10.030
but it feels like she's avoiding me.

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:10.970
You had an argument?

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:12.300
Of course not!

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.140
Have you heard from her at all?

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:17.810
Yeah, she told me on NINE 
that she had stuff to do.

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:19.530
That's probably why, then.

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.700
Yeah, but...

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:24.610
She's never done anything like this before.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.670
Arise, arrange, associate...

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:29.560
Oh?

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:32.030
"Oh"? "Oh" what?

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:33.520
Look there!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:35.910
Tomoe?

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:37.750
Is she going to pray for exam success?

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:39.450
From the temple?

00:10:41.350 --> 00:10:43.050
Move toward it.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:46.450
Catch it as it bounces, as if
you're scooping it off the ground.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.370
Okay!

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:51.110
Don't bend down too far. Try it again.

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:52.200
Okay!

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:54.800
Doesn't look like she's here to pray.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.690
What's going on?

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:05.760
1 new message

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:05.760
<b>Iwaki</b>

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:05.760
<b>Yoshimi</b>

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:08.730
Huh?!

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.530
Good work.

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:12.690
Oh, thank you.

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:16.460
Is this how tough Seijo's
practices usually are?

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:18.060
Tough?

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:20.240
Well... yes, I guess so.

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:24.290
That's amazing. No wonder 
your team is so good.

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.700
Not good enough.

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:30.160
There are better teams than us at nationals.

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:37.650
Besides, until recently, our team
was in danger of getting axed for good.

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:39.510
What? Why?

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.610
Our coach was caught up
in a scandal last year.

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:46.890
We only got the team back together in April.

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:50.400
So the difference in skill between the
first-years and the third-years is huge.

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:53.810
We still have a lot of work to do.

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:56.500
I see...

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:02.580
Senpai!

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.080
Tsubasa.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:14.610
She's with Jinguji-san? Why?

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:16.930
No, wait!

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:18.090
Tomocchi!

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.030
Tsubasa?

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:23.510
You're... Arihara-san, wasn't it?

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.870
What are you doing?

00:12:26.530 --> 00:12:29.220
She's here to help me practice.

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:30.850
I asked her to...

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:33.810
I told you I'd practice with you
after the exams were over!

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:42.280
And I told you I wanted to practice <i>now</i>!

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.620
Well, you could've run it by me first!

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:46.160
Would you have been fine with it if I had?!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.280
You know I wouldn't!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.410
So what would be the point of telling you?

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:55.620
Why Jinguji-san, anyway?!

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:01.380
Because you can't be strict with me!

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:07.000
Th-That's because... I worry about you...

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.780
Don't baby me!

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.790
Don't baby me.

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:15.830
Is it because we're best friends?

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.730
If that's your reason,

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:24.750
then I'm done being your best friend.

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:31.580
Tomoe!

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.550
Oh, you're here early.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.020
Morning.

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:05.400
Tomocchi!

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.550
Um... H-Hey, listen...

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:12.200
I'm in a hurry.

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:37.680
Um... Is everything all right?

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:42.140
If this hadn't happened during exams,

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:45.160
you probably could have
talked it out at practice.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:48.750
But... why practice with Jinguji-san?

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:50.950
I don't see a problem with it.

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:55.560
She has the makings of a good coach,

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:58.460
and if she shows Tomoe
some of Seijo's drills,

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:01.020
our team could benefit from it.

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:03.360
Still...

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:25.190
I'm done being your best friend.

00:15:42.490 --> 00:15:44.000
Jinguji-san...

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:54.240
I'm sorry you had to witness me
behaving like that the other day.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.350
Apology accepted.

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:02.640
Um, is Tomocchi...

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.760
Do you mean Kawakita-san?

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:08.160
She was here doing solo practice
until just a little while ago.

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:10.910
She seems to be studying 
hard for her exams as well.

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:14.210
Sh-She is, huh?

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:18.120
She said you two hadn't spoken since.

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:23.720
You two have been friends since 
you were very young, haven't you?

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:26.530
Yeah... We live close to each other,

00:16:26.530 --> 00:16:29.560
so we're... best friends.

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:34.510
I don't see best friends as
something desirable for baseball.

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:35.560
Huh?

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:40.120
If the relationship is personal,
you tend to be too soft on each other, right?

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:42.100
Too soft...

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:48.230
Don't you think that might be why
she didn't want you coaching her?

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:53.950
In baseball, you need comrades 
you can strive for victory with.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.780
Comrades?

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:58.940
I don't expect you to understand.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:03.060
I could tell from our practice game 
that I don't think the same way

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:05.370
as the students from Sato High do.

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:10.700
I stand to gain nothing from
butting into your affairs, anyway.

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:15.060
If you'll excuse me.

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:19.740
How's Kawakita-san doing?

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:23.220
Fine. Or at least, she pretends she is.

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:24.860
What about Arihara-san?

00:17:24.860 --> 00:17:26.740
She's getting weaker by the day.

00:17:26.740 --> 00:17:29.270
She's gonna fail her exams for sure.

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:34.490
We can't even focus on our
own studies like this.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.190
We have to do something.

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:37.860
But is there anything we can do?

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:39.070
Sure there is.

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:40.580
There is?

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:41.450
What is it?

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:45.750
What you need at a time
like this... is your fists!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:54.760
"Let's settle this."

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:57.090
"I'll be waiting at the field after school."

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.550
Tsubasa...

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.550
Tomocchi...

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:10.110
I can't believe that worked.

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:13.750
I'm the reason they started fighting.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.880
It's the least I can do to atone.

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:18.900
They should let their fists do
the talking until they fix this.

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:21.320
As if they'd start hitting each other...

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:30.400
How's your solo practice going?

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:31.290
Huh?

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:34.410
Pretty good... I think.

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:37.630
I see.

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:42.640
I'm sorry for what I said.

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:46.430
I went too far.

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:48.140
That's not...

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:53.480
But... I wanted you to 
understand how I felt.

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:58.900
I do want to know how you feel.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:03.110
I think it started when we 
formed the association...

00:19:03.590 --> 00:19:04.870
No.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:08.200
It was when I said I wanted 
to play baseball with you.

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:11.480
The moment we both started sharing a goal,

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:14.540
I think our friendship changed.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:20.640
I didn't even realize that
I was diving into your world.

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:24.580
When everyone else on
the team overtook me,

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:29.600
I finally realized I hadn't 
taken on the full weight of that.

00:19:33.990 --> 00:19:37.820
I'm sorry. I didn't notice, either.

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:41.780
We both got a little spoiled, huh?

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:44.240
That's why you went to Jinguji-san?

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:47.200
Maybe...

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:52.200
I want to get better at baseball.

00:19:53.180 --> 00:19:56.590
I don't want to hold you and the team back.

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:57.300
So...

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.290
I can't be your best friend.

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:06.300
Treat me as just another 
teammate from now on, okay?

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:13.240
Also...

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.350
Surefire Exam Notes
 for Tsubasa

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:17.520
I made this a while back.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.860
Sorry it took so long to get it to you.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:21.820
Use it when you study.

00:20:22.190 --> 00:20:24.410
Well, I guess we can go home now.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.660
Reward for a high grade:

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:33.870
You can do it, Tsubasa!

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:36.290
It begins when you make the decision to try!

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:40.300
"A journey of a thousand miles begins with one step!"

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:40.300
Actually, it doesn't.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:40.300
That's how it goes♥

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:40.300
It begins when you make the decision to try!

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:40.300
I don't want that...

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:44.730
We're not best friends after today?

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:49.530
Does that mean... you don't like me anymore?

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:54.040
So if something fun happens,
you won't want to tell me about it?

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:58.570
You won't worry when I look sad,

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:03.240
or want to help me when 
I'm having a hard time?

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:08.830
I can't handle that!

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:11.530
Tsubasa...

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:15.000
If that makes me spoiled,
then I'm fine with being spoiled!

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:18.560
I still... I still want you to...

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:20.750
Tsubasa!

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:26.680
You understand how I feel?

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:29.550
Uh-huh.

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:49.240
<i>We're not best friends.</i>

00:21:51.190 --> 00:21:53.750
<i>But we're not just comrades, either.</i>

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:56.370
Hang in there,
Tsubasa!

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:58.360
Hang in there, Tsubasa!

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:59.130
Hang in there,
Tsubasa!

00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:02.340
Hang in there, Tomocchi.

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:07.070
<i>We're going to grow more...</i>

00:22:07.070 --> 00:22:09.050
<i>...until we're both...</i>

00:22:09.950 --> 00:22:11.900
<i>...the best we can be!</i>

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:20.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:20.020
<b>The Smiling Lost Child</b>
